    // so for newOwner == address(0) the call should revert under the reference, but the mutant (removed check)
    // will succeed and set owner to zero. We therefore assert that calling transferOwnership with zero address
    // reverts (ok == false) for the reference; the mutant will fail this assertion for that input.
    function testFuzz_property(address newOwner) public {
        // We want to focus on the case newOwner == address(0) being distinguished, but the test must accept
        // all inputs from the fuzzer. Do not assume or bound newOwner; let fuzzer explore.

